<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#DC143C;">S<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1E90FF;">A<span id="id1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">M<span id="id1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8C00;">P<span id="id1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#9400D3;">O</span></span></span></span></span>: <span id="id2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#DC143C;">S</span>cale-wise
<span id="id3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1E90FF;">A</span>utoregression with
<span id="id4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">M</span>otion
<span id="id5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8C00;">P</span>r<span id="id6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#9400D3;">O</span>mpt for generative world models
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Sen Wang  Jingyi Tian  Le Wang  Zhimin Liao  Jiayi Li  Huaiyi Dong
