<figure id="S4.F4" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.15536v1/visual_compare.png" id="S4.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/149;" width="476" height="149" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span><span id="S4.F4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qualitative comparison of video prediction.</span> We compare SAMPO with iVideoGPT on the 1X World Model and RoboNet datasets under action-conditioned settings. SAMPO shows a clear advantage in modeling complex backgrounds and capturing dynamic object interactions over time.</figcaption>
</figure>
